> > > > > > >> > >> the
> > > > > > >> > >> > > extra opt-in mechanism, but it's a good
> > > > get-out-of-jail-free
> > > > > > >> card).
> > > > > > >> > >> > >
> > > > > > >> > >> > > 4. (minor point) Deprecation of methods
> > > > > > >> > >> > >
> > > > > > >> > >> > > You mentioned that the new `commit` method replaces
