}
{code}
=C2=A0

=C2=A0

Additionally, the Kafka Consumer/Producer Interceptor containers will imple=
ment a corresponding maybeOpen method which throws a checked Exception. =C2=
=A0It's called maybeOpen for backwards compatibility purpose as it must =C2=
=A0determine whether an interceptor's interface contains the newer open met=
hod before calling it accordingly.=C2=A0


=C2=A0*NOTE:* Developers are encouraged to throw a more specific exception.
