ConnectRestApiTest sometimes fails with the message

```
ConnectRestError(404, '<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=3D"Content-Type" co=
ntent=3D"text/html;charset=3DISO-8859-1"/>\n<title>Error 404 Not Found</tit=
le>\n</head>\n<body><h2>HTTP ERROR 404 Not Found</h2>\n<table>\n<tr><th>URI=
:</th><td>/connector-plugins/</td></tr>\n<tr><th>STATUS:</th><td>404</td></=
tr>\n<tr><th>MESSAGE:</th><td>Not Found</td></tr>\n<tr><th>SERVLET:</th><td=
>-</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n', 'http://172.31.1.75:8083/con=
nector-plugins/')
```

This happens because ConnectDistributedService.start() by default waits til=
l the the line

```
Joined group at generation ..
```
=C2=A0is visible in the logs.

In most cases this is sufficient. But in the cases where the test fails, we=
 see that this message appears even before Connect RestServer has finished =
initialization.

```
    - [2022-12-15 15:40:29,064] INFO [Worker clientId=3Dconnect-1, groupId=
=3Dconnect-cluster] Joined group at generation 2 with protocol version 1 an=
d got assignment: Assignment{error=3D0, leader=3D'connect-1-07d9da63-9acb-4=
633-aee4-1ab79f4ab1ae', leaderUrl=3D'http://worker34:8083/', offset=3D-1, c=
onnectorIds=3D[], taskIds=3D[], revokedConnectorIds=3D[], revokedTaskIds=3D=
[], delay=3D0} with rebalance delay: 0 (org.apache.kafka.connect.runtime.di=
stributed.DistributedHerder)
    - [2022-12-15 15:40:29,560] INFO 172.31.5.66 - - [15/Dec/2022:15:40:29 =
+0000] "GET /connector-plugins/ HTTP/1.1" 404 375 "-" "python-requests/2.24=
.0" 71 (org.apache.kafka.connect.runtime.rest.RestServer)
    - [2022-12-15 15:40:29,579] INFO REST resources initialized; server is =
started and ready to handle requests (org.apache.kafka.connect.runtime.rest=
.RestServer)

```

=C2=A0



