Hi all,

First off, congratulations to Daniel on your KIP passing!

With regards to the question of exactly-once support, I believe it should
be fully-supported by dedicated MM2 clusters once this KIP is implemented
and merged.

Speaking of implementation--I've already put together a patch for the
REST-related changes described in this KIP (but not the config
provider-related changes) to use on Aiven's fork of Mirror Maker 2. I've
reached out and discussed this with Daniel offline, and we've agreed to use
this patch for the implementation of the KIP on the official Kafka upstream
repo. I plan to file a PR for this patch in the next week or so.

Cheers,

Chris

