Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394

Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio created KAFKA-14619:
--------------------------------------------------

             Summary: KRaft validate snapshot id are at batch boundries
                 Key: KAFKA-14619
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14619
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: kraft
            Reporter: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio
            Assignee: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio


When the state machine creates a snapshot, kraft should validate that the p=
rovided offset lands at a record batch boundaries. This is required because=
 the current log layer and replication protocol do not handle the case wher=
e the snapshot id points to the middle of a record batch.



--
