David Arthur created KAFKA-14621:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Don't startup in migration mode if an authorizer is enabled
                 Key: KAFKA-14621
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14621
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
    Affects Versions: 3.4.0
            Reporter: David Arthur
            Assignee: David Arthur


In 3.4, we do not yet support migrating ACLs from ZK to KRaft. To avoid potential confusion and security problems, we should just disallow authorizers during the migration.



