             Summary: Compression optimization: Calculate the size of decompressed buffer dynamically at runtime.
                 Key: KAFKA-14634
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14634
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Divij Vaidya
            Assignee: Divij Vaidya
