> >>>>>>
> >>>>>> I'm +1 (binding)
> >>>>>>
> >>>>>> -John
> >>>>>>
> >>>>>> On Wed, Oct 12, 2022, at 16:36, Nick Telford wrote:
> >>>>>>> Can't wait!
